<title>USA: Putnam Investment Grade Q1 net increases.</title>
<headline>Putnam Investment Grade Q1 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three mos	 Three mos</p>
<p>						 ended	    ended</p>
<p>					  Jan. 31, 1997   Jan. 31, 1996</p>
<p>Total investment income</p>
<p> Total				     $4,131,932	$4,081,861</p>
<p> Per common share				 .31		 .31</p>
<p>Net investment income-</p>
<p> Total					2,996,850	 2,918,646</p>
<p> Per common share				 .22		 .22</p>
